OL,5,G0000 Bangers & Cash
OL,6,     FHealey/Porsche Soapbox: Austin
OL,7,     FHealeys are classic British
OL,8,     Fvehicles that are difficult to
OL,9,     Ftame. Paul and Charlie have the
OL,10,     Fchance to pick up a trio of these
OL,11,     Ficonic cars in varying conditions.
OL,12,G0100 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,13,     FSimon and Henry head to Wiltshire.
OL,14,     FHenry is feeling happy because
OL,15,     Fthey're going to an old WWII
OL,16,     Fairfield. Simon decides to restore
OL,17,     Fa 1970's caravan while Henry opts
OL,18,     Ffor a boat.
